  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - No amplified or other music shall be played in the premises outside the times10am to 11pm.",
    "Condition : 5 - The use hereby permitted for restaurant purposes shall not be carried on outside the  times 8am to 11pm",
    "Condition : 6 - No deliveries shall be taken at or despatched from the site outside the hours of 8am to 7pm nor at any time on Sundays, Bank or Public Holidays.",
    "Condition : 7 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8am  to 6pm on Mondays to Friday and 8am to1pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 8 - The use hereby permitted shall be confined to sales to customers attending the premises, and shall not extend to the delivery of food or drink to customers by vehicle.",
    "Condition : 9 - The use hereby permitted shall not be begun until details of the arrangements for storing of waste and recycled materials and their collection have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The arrangements for storing waste and recycled materials and their collection shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be completed before any part of the accommodation hereby permitted is occupied. Hours of collection shall be between 7am and 10pm.",
    "Condition : 10 - The use shall not commence until a scheme for control of fumes and odours including details of sound attenuation for any necessary plant has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority in writing.",
    "Condition : 11 - The use shall not commence until a scheme for the ventilation of the premises of an appropriate outlet level, including details of sound attenuation for any necessary plant and the standard or dilution expected has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 12 - The scheme of ventilation approved under Condition 12 shall be fully implemented before the use is commenced.",
    "Condition : 13 - ."
